1
00:01:30,310 --> 00:01:33,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Jiraiya Ninja Scrolls:</i>
<i>The Tale of Naruto the Hero-</i>
<i>Collision</i>


</b></font>

2
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:57,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>There it is!</b></font>

3
00:01:57,480 --> 00:01:59,060
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That tower is Sasuke's goal.</b></font>

4
00:01:59,730 --> 00:02:00,770
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Where's Sasuke?</b></font>

5
00:02:00,980 --> 00:02:02,520
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>He's already inside.</b></font>

6
00:02:15,690 --> 00:02:19,940
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Our strategy to weaken them one by one
is making them impatient.</b></font>

7
00:02:20,940 --> 00:02:22,940
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Those two plan on
settling this all at once.</b></font>

8
00:02:23,650 --> 00:02:26,230
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>There are just two of them,
but there are three of us!</b></font>

9
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:27,940
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's no big deal!</b></font>

10
00:02:28,110 --> 00:02:30,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>No, actually, there are
quite a few problems.</b></font>

11
00:02:31,440 --> 00:02:32,810
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Neji, I'm counting on you!</b></font>

12
00:02:32,900 --> 00:02:33,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I‘ve got it.</b></font>

13
00:02:40,860 --> 00:02:45,190
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The three of us can handle
the two of them!</b></font>

14
00:02:45,310 --> 00:02:46,770
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Don't worry, just run!</b></font>

15
00:03:02,060 --> 00:03:03,060
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's useless…</b></font>

16
00:03:03,440 --> 00:03:04,810
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The entry to the suspension bridge
is already</b></font>

17
00:03:04,900 --> 00:03:06,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>within the range of
my Eight Trigrams.</b></font>

18
00:03:07,900 --> 00:03:11,310
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Neither of you can enter this area.</b></font>

19
00:03:11,900 --> 00:03:12,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I wonder about that.</b></font>

20
00:03:23,150 --> 00:03:24,150
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>A clone?</b></font>

21
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:25,520
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Damn it!</b></font>

22
00:03:27,480 --> 00:03:29,940
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I guess I shouldn't get too greedy,
because one is my quota…</b></font>

23
00:03:30,810 --> 00:03:32,190
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I will not let you pass!</b></font>

24
00:03:40,900 --> 00:03:42,480
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Striking Shadow Snakes!</b></font>

25
00:03:43,730 --> 00:03:45,060
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Gentle Fist!</b></font>

26
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:46,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>8 Trigram 2 Palms!</b></font>

27
00:03:46,770 --> 00:03:47,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>4 Palms!</b></font>

28
00:03:50,810 --> 00:03:51,810
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>8 Palms!</b></font>

29
00:03:51,900 --> 00:03:53,020
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>16 Palms!</b></font>

30
00:03:53,150 --> 00:03:54,400
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>32 Palms!</b></font>

31
00:03:54,730 --> 00:03:55,810
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>64 Palms!</b></font>

32
00:04:15,230 --> 00:04:16,230
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>He's here!</b></font>

33
00:04:18,860 --> 00:04:20,690
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Damn it…from above?</b></font>

34
00:04:22,020 --> 00:04:23,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Hurry to the entrance!</b></font>

35
00:04:37,810 --> 00:04:39,310
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Naruto, are you all right?!</b></font>

36
00:04:40,060 --> 00:04:41,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Yeah, I'm okay.</b></font>

37
00:04:47,810 --> 00:04:49,770
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Sasuke is up there…</i></b></font>

38
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Naruto! Go on ahead!</b></font>

39
00:04:52,860 --> 00:04:54,270
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'll stop him.</b></font>

40
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:56,770
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What are you talking about!
You're coming with…!</b></font>

41
00:04:56,860 --> 00:05:00,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>No…don't tell me it's because
I'm the Hokage's son?!</b></font>

42
00:05:01,980 --> 00:05:05,190
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's right…
You're the Hokage's son.</b></font>

43
00:05:07,650 --> 00:05:11,230
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>In my own way,
I've watched you two all this time.</b></font>

44
00:05:12,900 --> 00:05:14,940
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The one who can sway Sasuke…</b></font>

45
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:19,440
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The one who can bring
Sasuke back is you, Naruto.</b></font>

46
00:05:19,520 --> 00:05:20,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You're the only one
who can do it.</b></font>

47
00:05:21,810 --> 00:05:22,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Shikamaru…</b></font>

48
00:05:23,940 --> 00:05:26,020
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>He's coming! Hurry, Naruto!</b></font>

49
00:05:27,020 --> 00:05:28,020
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Yeah!</b></font>

50
00:05:29,730 --> 00:05:31,940
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm counting on you, Shikamaru!</b></font>

51
00:05:47,190 --> 00:05:49,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Shadow Possession Jutsu…
complete.</b></font>

52
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:51,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>So you're a shadow user…</b></font>

53
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:53,400
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sorry, but…</b></font>

54
00:05:53,730 --> 00:05:56,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>…you're going to keep me
company right here.</b></font>

55
00:05:57,230 --> 00:05:59,060
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I bear no grudge toward
any one of you.</b></font>

56
00:05:59,650 --> 00:06:01,230
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>This is my mission.</b></font>

57
00:06:01,900 --> 00:06:05,020
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>By the way, did you happen to catch
what the weather report was today?</b></font>

58
00:06:07,940 --> 00:06:10,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's supposed to be cloudy
with some rain.</b></font>

59
00:06:19,610 --> 00:06:22,310
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Damn it,
this is not my kind of thing.</b></font>

60
00:06:41,150 --> 00:06:42,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You must be Sasuke.</b></font>

61
00:06:43,110 --> 00:06:44,310
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I've been waiting for you.</b></font>

62
00:06:45,150 --> 00:06:46,310
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You're Orochimaru…</b></font>

63
00:06:47,730 --> 00:06:50,810
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I understand there's something
you desire very much…</b></font>

64
00:06:51,650 --> 00:06:52,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's power!</b></font>

65
00:06:53,480 --> 00:06:56,520
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Enough power to be able to
hold this world within my fist!</b></font>

66
00:06:58,730 --> 00:07:00,810
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Such a promising statement.</b></font>

67
00:07:23,060 --> 00:07:24,060
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm sorry…</b></font>

68
00:07:24,150 --> 00:07:27,810
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I took a shortcut and
I've been waiting for you.</b></font>

69
00:07:28,860 --> 00:07:31,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Just a little farther,
and I'll catch up to Sasuke!</b></font>

70
00:07:31,940 --> 00:07:33,440
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Why are you interfering?!</b></font>

71
00:07:34,150 --> 00:07:36,440
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You won't get to Sasuke.</b></font>

72
00:07:37,190 --> 00:07:38,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I won't let you go any further.</b></font>

73
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:40,690
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Shut up!</b></font>

74
00:07:40,770 --> 00:07:43,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I won't let Sasuke become a vessel!</b></font>

75
00:07:49,310 --> 00:07:50,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>This chakra is…</i></b></font>

76
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:59,150
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You want it, don't you, kid?</b></font>

77
00:07:59,770 --> 00:08:01,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You want my power.</b></font>

78
00:08:17,610 --> 00:08:19,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Four tails…so suddenly?</i></b></font>

79
00:08:19,940 --> 00:08:21,270
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>How can this be?</i></b></font>

80
00:08:36,770 --> 00:08:39,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Hokage Style Elder Jutsu:
Tenth Edict on Enlightenment!</b></font>

81
00:08:56,810 --> 00:08:59,020
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What? Is this even possible?</b></font>

82
00:09:05,690 --> 00:09:06,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The fifth tail?!</b></font>

83
00:09:18,700 --> 00:09:19,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Power…</b></font>

84
00:09:19,990 --> 00:09:21,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Hurry and give me power…</b></font>

85
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>How impatient…</b></font>

86
00:10:02,030 --> 00:10:03,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>He stopped…</i></b></font>

87
00:10:05,490 --> 00:10:08,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke!</b></font>

88
00:10:09,820 --> 00:10:12,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You can't do that after
coming this far.</b></font>

89
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:14,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You need my power, don't you?</b></font>

90
00:10:15,650 --> 00:10:17,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I don't need power.</b></font>

91
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:19,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I just want to talk to Sasuke.</b></font>

92
00:10:19,860 --> 00:10:22,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>So can you back off right now?</b></font>

93
00:11:11,110 --> 00:11:12,150
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke!</b></font>

94
00:11:14,280 --> 00:11:16,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What happened to you?</b></font>

95
00:11:17,530 --> 00:11:19,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's amazing, Sasuke.</b></font>

96
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:22,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Your body is already adapting
to the power.</b></font>

97
00:11:24,070 --> 00:11:26,400
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You must be Orochimaru!</b></font>

98
00:11:26,780 --> 00:11:29,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>W-What did you do to Sasuke?!</b></font>

99
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:34,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I fulfilled Sasuke's desire,
that's all.</b></font>

100
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:36,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What did you say?</b></font>

101
00:11:37,030 --> 00:11:39,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You're still annoying as ever…</b></font>

102
00:11:39,650 --> 00:11:40,740
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke!</b></font>

103
00:11:41,530 --> 00:11:43,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm here to bring you back!</b></font>

104
00:11:45,400 --> 00:11:49,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Give me a break!
What can a loser like you do?</b></font>

105
00:11:50,030 --> 00:11:52,150
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'll bring you back by force,
if necessary…</b></font>

106
00:11:52,280 --> 00:11:53,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Just try it.</b></font>

107
00:11:53,700 --> 00:11:55,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm not going to lose to you!</b></font>

108
00:11:59,240 --> 00:12:02,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I feel a surge of power…</b></font>

109
00:12:14,650 --> 00:12:16,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>What is this power?</i></b></font>

110
00:12:16,450 --> 00:12:18,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>This is different…even compared</i>
<i>to the other day!</i></b></font>

111
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:21,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Don't you get it, Sasuke?!</b></font>

112
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:23,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Orochimaru is…</b></font>

113
00:12:24,150 --> 00:12:25,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>trying to make you his!</b></font>

114
00:12:28,280 --> 00:12:29,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's power!</b></font>

115
00:12:29,450 --> 00:12:32,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>As long as I have power,
that doesn't matter to me!</b></font>

116
00:12:35,490 --> 00:12:36,740
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Chidori Stream!</b></font>

117
00:12:47,150 --> 00:12:49,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Change in Chakra Form</i>
<i>comes so easily…</i></b></font>

118
00:12:50,280 --> 00:12:51,400
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>This power…</i></b></font>

119
00:12:52,990 --> 00:12:55,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'll show you the enormous
difference in my power!</b></font>

120
00:12:57,110 --> 00:13:01,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>All right…I'll show you too!</b></font>

121
00:13:01,570 --> 00:13:03,740
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What power is…!</b></font>

122
00:13:05,110 --> 00:13:06,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Well, how about it?</i></b></font>

123
00:13:08,820 --> 00:13:11,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It should be fully infused by now.</b></font>

124
00:13:16,110 --> 00:13:17,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Get ready, Sasuke!</b></font>

125
00:13:19,070 --> 00:13:20,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>What?</i></b></font>

126
00:13:20,200 --> 00:13:21,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>What happened to him?</i></b></font>

127
00:13:27,860 --> 00:13:29,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Just plain taijutsu? Is that all?</i></b></font>

128
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:32,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>What?</i></b></font>

129
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:34,490
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I thought I dodged it</i>
<i>with my Sharingan…!</i></b></font>

130
00:13:45,400 --> 00:13:46,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>This boy…</b></font>

131
00:13:46,700 --> 00:13:48,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>used Nature Energy…</b></font>

132
00:13:49,110 --> 00:13:49,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>This is…</b></font>

133
00:13:52,400 --> 00:13:54,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's Sage Mode!</b></font>

134
00:13:59,490 --> 00:14:01,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>All this power…</i></b></font>

135
00:14:04,110 --> 00:14:05,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Naruto!</b></font>

136
00:14:05,070 --> 00:14:06,400
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Why do you…?!</b></font>

137
00:14:07,200 --> 00:14:08,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Why does it always have to be you?!</b></font>

138
00:14:09,450 --> 00:14:12,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Stop saying nonsense
and let's go home.</b></font>

139
00:14:14,110 --> 00:14:14,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I see…</i></b></font>

140
00:14:15,950 --> 00:14:18,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>That power has a time limit.</i></b></font>

141
00:14:19,700 --> 00:14:20,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Well then…</i></b></font>

142
00:14:20,990 --> 00:14:23,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Fire Style: Dragon Flame Jutsu!</b></font>

143
00:14:33,610 --> 00:14:36,400
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You disgust me, Naruto…</b></font>

144
00:14:36,740 --> 00:14:37,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Get lost!</b></font>

145
00:14:54,900 --> 00:14:56,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Disappear along with the thunder!</b></font>

146
00:15:16,900 --> 00:15:18,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You lost focus, didn't you?</b></font>

147
00:15:18,740 --> 00:15:20,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Your real target is over here.</b></font>

148
00:15:21,240 --> 00:15:22,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke…</b></font>

149
00:15:22,450 --> 00:15:24,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You'd really do this…</b></font>

150
00:15:27,240 --> 00:15:27,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>…to me?</b></font>

151
00:15:30,740 --> 00:15:32,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What's so funny?</b></font>

152
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:34,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke…</b></font>

153
00:15:35,070 --> 00:15:38,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I've always thought that
you and I were alike.</b></font>

154
00:15:39,570 --> 00:15:40,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What are you saying?</b></font>

155
00:15:41,900 --> 00:15:43,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm the Hokage's son.</b></font>

156
00:15:44,530 --> 00:15:46,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You're the son of
the Leaf's Police Force Chief,</b></font>

157
00:15:46,570 --> 00:15:48,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>from the prestigious Uchiha Clan.</b></font>

158
00:15:49,700 --> 00:15:54,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>We both grew up constantly
being compared to our dads…</b></font>

159
00:15:55,490 --> 00:15:57,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>How hard it is to live under
someone's shadow…</b></font>

160
00:15:58,820 --> 00:16:01,740
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>to always be watched by others…</b></font>

161
00:16:02,570 --> 00:16:07,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I thought you were the one person
who understood all that.</b></font>

162
00:16:09,150 --> 00:16:11,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Even though our situations
were the same,</b></font>

163
00:16:11,150 --> 00:16:12,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>you were totally different…</b></font>

164
00:16:12,900 --> 00:16:15,400
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You kept progressing and
getting better…</b></font>

165
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:18,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>At first, I was frustrated.</b></font>

166
00:16:18,700 --> 00:16:21,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But then, I was proud of you.</b></font>

167
00:16:21,450 --> 00:16:26,150
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's why I decided to do
my best and be like you.</b></font>

168
00:16:26,610 --> 00:16:29,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You've been my role model
all this time!</b></font>

169
00:16:30,240 --> 00:16:31,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Well, I'm different.</b></font>

170
00:16:32,740 --> 00:16:34,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You should've just stayed the same.</b></font>

171
00:16:35,070 --> 00:16:37,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Why couldn't you have
just stayed a loser?</b></font>

172
00:16:38,240 --> 00:16:40,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The weak and useless son
of the Hokage?!</b></font>

173
00:16:41,150 --> 00:16:42,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke…</b></font>

174
00:16:42,780 --> 00:16:46,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Even you…even you had
to become strong…</b></font>

175
00:16:47,570 --> 00:16:49,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You don't know how much
that made me…!</b></font>

176
00:16:49,740 --> 00:16:51,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Is that why…</b></font>

177
00:16:51,400 --> 00:16:54,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Is that why you sought power?!</b></font>

178
00:16:54,280 --> 00:16:56,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's right, Naruto!</b></font>

179
00:16:56,570 --> 00:16:58,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The power to bring you down!</b></font>

180
00:17:03,780 --> 00:17:05,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You're the one…</b></font>

181
00:17:05,990 --> 00:17:07,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>who's a loser.</b></font>

182
00:17:09,150 --> 00:17:11,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>W-What is this</i>
<i>red chakra…</i></b></font>

183
00:17:12,150 --> 00:17:13,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>He still has power like this?!</i></b></font>

184
00:17:17,570 --> 00:17:18,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Naruto…</b></font>

185
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:22,150
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>His power is levels above this.</b></font>

186
00:17:22,860 --> 00:17:25,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You have no choice
but to use my power.</b></font>

187
00:17:33,150 --> 00:17:34,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm gonna stop you</b></font>

188
00:17:34,570 --> 00:17:36,740
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>even if I have to break every bone
in your arms and legs!</b></font>

189
00:17:37,900 --> 00:17:40,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Just what are you?!</b></font>

190
00:17:41,110 --> 00:17:42,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm your friend!</b></font>

191
00:17:45,700 --> 00:17:50,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's why I'm saying I'm never gonna
let Orochimaru have you!</b></font>

192
00:17:59,570 --> 00:18:00,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Fine, I acknowledge you.</b></font>

193
00:18:01,280 --> 00:18:03,400
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'll fight you as an equal from now.</b></font>

194
00:18:04,070 --> 00:18:08,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>However, you won't be able to put
a single mark on my headband.</b></font>

195
00:18:13,110 --> 00:18:15,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke!</b></font>

196
00:18:30,320 --> 00:18:31,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Rasengan!</b></font>

197
00:18:31,900 --> 00:18:32,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Chidori!</b></font>

198
00:18:47,280 --> 00:18:48,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Big Brother!</b></font>

199
00:18:50,780 --> 00:18:52,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I came to bring you back,</b></font>

200
00:18:53,400 --> 00:18:55,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>but it seems I'm a little late.</b></font>

201
00:18:56,280 --> 00:18:57,150
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>No way!</b></font>

202
00:18:58,530 --> 00:18:59,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Naruto…</b></font>

203
00:19:00,200 --> 00:19:02,400
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Naruto, please get along
with my little brother.</b></font>

204
00:19:09,280 --> 00:19:11,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Forgive me, Sasuke.</b></font>

205
00:20:33,650 --> 00:20:36,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That was quite entertaining.</b></font>

206
00:22:37,490 --> 00:22:39,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>W-What is that?

</b></font>

207
00:22:39,780 --> 00:22:44,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>As you can see, it's something that
defies the boundaries of reality…

</b></font>

208
00:22:45,530 --> 00:22:48,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Neji, is everyone in the village safe?

</b></font>

209
00:22:48,280 --> 00:22:51,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Can you confirm what that big thing
is with your Byakugan?

</b></font>

210
00:22:51,650 --> 00:22:53,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm already doing that!

</b></font>

211
00:22:54,490 --> 00:22:58,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Next time on Naruto Shippuden:
"Another Moon"



</b></font>

212
00:22:58,950 --> 00:23:02,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I don't know what kind of jutsu that is,
but I'll undo it!



</b></font>

213
00:23:02,610 --> 00:23:04,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Jiraiya Ninja Scrolls:
The Tale of Naruto the Hero-
Another Moon



</b></font>

214
00:23:04,840 --> 00:23:10,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Tune in again!


</b></font>

